   6:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdpostct.c ****  * For conditions of distribution and use, see the accompanying README file.
   7:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdpostct.c ****  *
   8:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdpostct.c ****  * This file contains the decompression postprocessing controller.
   9:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdpostct.c ****  * This controller manages the upsampling, color conversion, and color
  10:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdpostct.c ****  * quantization/reduction steps; specifically, it controls the buffering
  11:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdpostct.c ****  * between upsample/color conversion and color quantization/reduction.
  12:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdpostct.c ****  *
  13:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdpostct.c ****  * If no color quantization/reduction is required, then this module has no
  14:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdpostct.c ****  * work to do, and it just hands off to the upsample/color conversion code.
  15:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdpostct.c ****  * An integrated upsample/convert/quantize process would replace this module
  16:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdpostct.c ****  * entirely.
  17:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdpostct.c ****  */
  18:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdpostct.c **** 
  19:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdpostct.c **** #define JPEG_INTERNALS
